{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dracoslayer</strong> is a thrilling fighting game that combines intense high-paced action with the strategic use of elemental abilities. Dive into an immersive combat experience where every skill and elemental property can shape the battle to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Elements:</strong><br>Unleash a wide variety of unique skills and craft powerful strategies to outsmart your enemies and secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623430/extras/a5cc66350ec0ff27d49f55d6090b0703.avif?t=1753704484\" width=1500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Energy gameplay:</strong> <br>Short, snappy combos and fast movement make every match a rhapsody of skill and tactics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong><br>Embark on an epic adventure through the world of Dracoslayer. Face relentless waves of enemies, and battle formidable bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623430/extras/e14fef37ceafc6791f07b5da95affe89.avif?t=1753704484\" width=1500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus Mode:</strong><br>Test your skills in 1v1 battles! Challenge a friend in local multiplayer or face off against AI opponents in adrenaline-pumping duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner warrior and dominate the battlefield in <strong>Dracoslayer</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2623430?t=1753704484","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2623430?t=1753704484","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste